games/lwjgl2: create with jMonkeyEngine/lwjgl2 2.9.5

LWJGL 2 (The Lightweight Java Game Library) provides high-performance
OpenGL, OpenCL and OpenAL libraries for Java.  Add a copy with patches
against the jMonkeyEngine "maintained" repository, a binary-compatible
release of LWJGL 2 that also lacks NetBSD support.  The patches may be
upstreamed in the future.

